---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import QuoteSection from "../components/QuoteSection.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import portrait from "../assets/photos/IMG_8285.JPG";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About · ${site.legalName}`}
  description="Walter's is an owner operated landscaping and construction company in Chapel Hill, founded by Jesse Walters. Five years in, fully insured, built on word of mouth."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-12 pt-16 lg:px-6 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-24">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <h1 class="font-heading text-h2 font-bold text-green-900">
          Owner operated, and obsessed with the details.
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 font-sans text-body text-green-800 sm:text-lg/relaxed">
          <p>
            I started this company at 17. I loved being outside and I loved the idea of giving people
            a little peace of mind about their own homes. That was enough to get the gears turning.
          </p>
          <p>
            What began as a small handyman-and-landscaping operation has grown into the full
            landscaping and construction company we run today. It happened with a lot of help and the
            support of this community: we served hundreds of customers in 2023 alone, and along the way
            I was able to build my own home at 21 and marry my high-school sweetheart.
          </p>
          {/* TODO[CONFIRM]: customers-served figures. Discovery noted "hundreds in 2023 / countless over 5 yrs"; the draft's "thousands" wording is unconfirmed, so we use "countless" below. */}
          <p>
            Five years in, we've cared for countless yards and projects across the greater Chapel Hill
            and Durham area, and we'd welcome whatever you've got next. My team and I have one job:
            excellent service, top-quality results, every time.
          </p>
          <p class="font-sans text-body font-bold text-green-700">– Jesse Walters</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="A Walter's landscaping and construction project"
          widths={[480, 768]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <QuoteSection />
</BaseLayout>
